(7) If the registration of a person as an insurance broker has been cancelled or has expired, sections 81 and 94, unless the Authority otherwise directs, continue to apply in relation to the person in respect of matters that occurred before the cancellation or expiration as if its registration had not been cancelled or had not expired, as the case may be.
